+#                        the "command not found" suggestion (#62). `format` is the kind of
+#                        source (only `sqlite`), `path` the file (opened read-only, never
+#                        fetched), `query` one SQL statement with a single `?` for the command
+#                        word that returns package names in its first column. Here: the
+#                        command-not-found database, tables commands(command, pkgID) and
